- income tax on employment and other income;
- sales taxes including the Goods and Services Tax (GST) and the Provincial Sales Tax (PST);
- property taxes;
- customs duties or tariffs on certain imported and exported goods; and,
- contributions by employers and employees to social security plans such as the Employment Insurance (EI) system and the Canada Pension Plan (CPP).

